00:22:12.840 --> 00:22:15.560
Not unless it snows and you need something to grit the path with.

00:22:20.610 --> 00:22:22.340
Sorry. I'm sorry about that.

00:22:22.380 --> 00:22:24.080
I've been on my own for three million years,

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:25.970
and I'm just used to saying what I think.

00:22:26.190 --> 00:22:28.360
I think I've gone a bit peculiar, to tell you the truth.

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:31.560
Everyone's dead. I'm on me own. It's just me.

00:22:32.120 --> 00:22:33.320
Well, technically speaking, yeah.

00:22:33.600 --> 00:22:35.180
What do you mean, technically speaking?

00:22:38.330 --> 00:22:40.890
Hello, Lister. Long time no see.

00:22:41.360 --> 00:22:42.520
Remember, you're a hologram?

00:22:43.090 --> 00:22:44.270
Yes, that's because I'm dead.

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:48.060
Dead is a can of Spam, and it's all thanks to you.

00:22:48.420 --> 00:22:49.280
Me? What did I do?

00:22:49.730 --> 00:22:53.050
If you hadn't kept that stupid cat, Lister, and hadn't been sent to stasis,

00:22:53.170 --> 00:22:55.990
I would have had some help when I was mending the drive plate, and I wouldn't be dead.

00:22:57.240 --> 00:22:57.740
Feel like?

00:22:58.340 --> 00:22:59.960
Death. It's like being...

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:01.400
on holiday with a group of Germans.

00:23:02.500 --> 00:23:03.960
No, I mean

00:23:03.960 --> 00:23:04.940
being a hologram.

00:23:06.880 --> 00:23:10.100
Being a hologram is fine, Lister. I still have

00:23:10.100 --> 00:23:12.000
the same drives, the same feelings,

00:23:12.180 --> 00:23:14.730
the same emotions, but I can't touch

00:23:14.730 --> 00:23:17.180
anything. Never again will I be able to

00:23:17.180 --> 00:23:19.660
brush a rose against my cheek, cradle

00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:22.160
a laughing child, or interfere with

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:23.100
a woman sexually.

00:23:24.480 --> 00:23:26.360
You should do any of those things anyway.

00:23:26.780 --> 00:23:28.620
But I would have done one day, murderer.

00:23:28.720 --> 00:23:29.980
Hey, hey, I didn't do any...

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:32.980
and it was you who didn't fix the drive plates properly.

00:23:33.200 --> 00:23:34.280
Is this me here?

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:35.270
Yeah.

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:35.900
Me?

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:38.260
Come on, Ripper, look on the bright side.

00:23:38.820 --> 00:23:40.820
The bright side? What bright side?

00:23:41.500 --> 00:23:43.800
I'm dead, I'm composed entirely of light

00:23:43.800 --> 00:23:46.160
and I'm alone in space with a man who'd lose a battle of wits

00:23:46.160 --> 00:23:47.120
with a stuffed iguana.

00:23:47.380 --> 00:23:48.360
Where's the bright side?

00:23:49.410 --> 00:23:50.230
What's an iguana?

00:23:51.120 --> 00:23:53.220
And look, look, you're not dead, are you?

00:23:53.620 --> 00:23:56.070
I mean, you're dead, but you're not dead dead

00:23:56.070 --> 00:23:57.130
because you're still here, aren't you?

00:23:57.520 --> 00:23:59.040
Listen, I'm not really here.

00:23:59.290 --> 00:23:59.970
I'm not really...

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:05.950
me, don't you see? I'm a computer simulation of me. That's me there, that pile of albino

00:24:05.950 --> 00:24:11.350
mouse droppings. Come on, lots of people have died. Lots of people have died and gone undone

00:24:11.350 --> 00:24:17.200
really, really well. You're a hologram, so what? I suppose you're right, Lister. I've

00:24:17.200 --> 00:24:21.380
got to pull myself together, but you've got to help me. You've got to be my hands and

00:24:21.380 --> 00:24:26.920
my touch. I know the sort of things you like to touch. No way, rim and forget it. Are you

00:24:26.920 --> 00:24:29.970
smoking, Lister, in the drive room? Yeah, I stopped for...

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:40.440
quite a while but I'm back on them now. Your own report, squire. I can't write it down. I'll

00:24:40.440 --> 00:24:45.880
remember it. Ruma, look, I know it's wrong of me to speak ill of the dead and all that but you're

00:24:45.880 --> 00:24:51.050
still a smeghead. I beg your pardon? Yes, sir, you're still a smeghead. Lister, do you have any

00:24:51.050 --> 00:24:55.010
