Oh, it's my shadow. Hey, even my shadow's looking nice.

00:25:45.660 --> 00:25:49.040
I'm looking nice. My shadow's looking nice. What a team.

00:25:49.480 --> 00:25:50.700
We are unbelievable.

00:25:51.360 --> 00:25:55.210
Okay, team, this way. No, this way.

