Better make myself look big.

00:26:17.240 --> 00:26:17.660
Fiersome.

00:26:18.170 --> 00:26:19.270
I was fearsome.

00:26:20.960 --> 00:26:22.490
And my shadow.

00:26:23.430 --> 00:26:23.970
Come on, boy.

00:26:24.680 --> 00:26:25.800
Fucking hell me.

